>
> Murder/Killing a priest does not cause you to lose protection. Praying on
> his altar would though. Protection loss is because your god is angry with
> you. Moloch would be angry about killing one of his priests, but Moloch can
> go sit on some poisoned pit spikes for all the difference it makes in your
> divine protection.

Quibbles: 

1. Sufficiently pissing off Moloch (say by praying to him) will
cause loss of protection.
2. Killing an aligned priest doesn't anger its god (in the usual
senses of anger), although the god will react when you attack such a
priest in melee.  Killing a priest of your *own* alignment, however,
will annoy your god just enough to cost you protection.
3. Upsetting *any* god sufficiently (see sacrificing a unicorn on an
altar of its own alignment) will cost you protection.

See http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Anger


